
SO101 Leader Arm (Human Control)
SO101 Follower Arm (Execution)
Feetech Servo Motors
USB Camera (Top View)
Containers (Cup/Bottle)
🔁 Workflow
1️⃣ Motor Configuration

Assign motor IDs for all joints.

2️⃣ Calibration

Calibrate both leader and follower arms for accurate motion mapping.

3️⃣ Teleoperation

Control follower arm using leader arm to demonstrate pouring motion.

4️⃣ Data Recording

Record:

Joint positions
Actions
Camera frames
5️⃣ Model Training

Train a model using recorded demonstrations.

6️⃣ Inference (Autonomous Mode)

Robot performs water pouring without human control.
